                <pb facs="0543" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v16/pg517"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Secretary Dulles visited Paris, April 13–14, and met with Foreign Minister
                    Bidault and other French officials to discuss the situation in Indochina and
                    matters related to the Geneva Conference. For documentation on their
                    conversations, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v13p1">volume XIII</ref>. The
                    communiqué released on April 14 was issued as Department of State press release
                    197 of April 14 and was published in the Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, April 26, 1954, page 622.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
